      "diff": "--- accepted/L095/universal-locally-projective.tex#8\n+++ universal-polytope.tex#4\n@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@\n \\begin{theorem}\\label{census}\n-The full quotient classification for $\\mathcal P$ has $137$ isomorphism classes, with $26$ maximal semisparse subgroup classes and $349$ maximal-containment edges. It contains $65$ quotients with the original local types, one with only hemi-dodecahedral facets, and $71$ with mixed facets. Exactly $66$ are section regular. All facet counts, all actual subgroup representatives and all quotient automorphism groups are specified in the included complete census tables.\n+The full quotient classification for $\\mathcal P$ has $137$ isomorphism classes, with $26$ maximal semisparse subgroup classes and $349$ maximal-containment edges. It contains $65$ quotients with the original local types, one with only hemi-dodecahedral facets, and $71$ with mixed facets. Exactly $66$ are section regular. All facet counts, all actual subgroup representatives and all quotient automorphism groups are specified in the complete common census tables.\n \\end{theorem}"
